BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:r-beginner-bluegrass-jam-20261116@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261119T001009Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261116T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261116T210000
SUMMARY:PineCone beginner bluegrass jam · Harry's Guitar Shop
LOCATION:Harry's Guitar Shop\, 556 Pylon Dr\, Raleigh\, NC 27606
DESCRIPTION:Coached jam for people with little or no experience playing wit
 h others\, facilitated by Jef Walter. Each month has first-timers alongsid
 e people who have come for years.\n\nFirst hour is one big group that stop
 s to talk through songs\; second hour splits into two smaller groups\n\nHo
 w to join: Just show up with your instrument\n\nBefore you go: Meets on 3r
 d Mondays at Harry's (the separate 4th-Monday open jam is now at Raleigh B
 rewing). Jan 18 (MLK Day) and Feb 15 aren't posted yet.\n\nhttps://pinecon
 e.org/event/pinecone-beginners-bluegrass-jam-6/\n\nListed on Same Time Nex
 t Week.
URL:https://pinecone.org/event/pinecone-beginners-bluegrass-jam-6/
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="556 Pylon Dr, Raleigh, NC 
 27606";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Harry's Guitar Shop":geo:35.791946,-78.7
 03358
END:VEVENT
