BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:r-open-mic-rebus-works-20261203@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261119T001009Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T200000
SUMMARY:Open mic · Rebus Works
LOCATION:Rebus Works\, 301-2 Kinsey St\, Raleigh\, NC 27603
DESCRIPTION:First-Thursday open mic for music\, poetry and comedy in a smal
 l Boylan Heights gallery and community space. The crowd is friendly and th
 e regulars return each month.\n\nSign-up starts at 5pm\; the house backing
  band is available if you want it\n\nHow to join: Sign up in person from 5
 pm\n\nBefore you go: Rebus Works skips January (closed Jan 5–9). Februar
 y's date isn't posted yet.\n\nhttps://www.rebusworks.us/calendar\n\nListed
  on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.rebusworks.us/calendar
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:r-bluegrass-jam-class-20261205@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261119T001009Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T160000
SUMMARY:Holiday bluegrass jam class · St. Paul's Church
LOCATION:St. Paul's Christian Church\, 3331 Blue Ridge Rd\, Raleigh\, NC 27
 612
DESCRIPTION:One-day bluegrass jamming class taught by Leslie Dare and Susan
  West. No jam experience is needed if you can tune and change smoothly bet
 ween G\, C\, D and A. It's a good way into the PineCone jams.\n\nCheck the
  class times before you go. Bring your own lunch\; there's an ugly sweater
  contest.\n\nHow to join: Register online on the Wernick Method website (c
 reate an account)\; the songbook is sent after you register\n\nBefore you 
 go: Watch the Wernick Method website for future Raleigh classes.\n\nhttps:
 //wernickmethod.org/event/ld-sw-2026-12-raleigh\n\nListed on Same Time Nex
 t Week.
URL:https://wernickmethod.org/event/ld-sw-2026-12-raleigh
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="3331 Blue Ridge Rd, Raleig
 h, NC 27612";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="St. Paul's Christian Church":geo:3
 5.824621,-78.698459
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:r-line-dancing-transfer-co-20261112@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261119T001009Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261112T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261112T220000
SUMMARY:Line dancing · Transfer Co. Ballroom
LOCATION:Transfer Co. Ballroom (inside Transfer Co. Food Hall)\, 500 E Davi
 e St\, Ste 160\, Raleigh\, NC 27601
DESCRIPTION:Weekly line dance class taught by Lexi Lloyd\, followed by open
  dancing\, for all ages and skill levels. Icebreakers and games make it ea
 sy to meet people.\n\nBeginner lesson first\, then open dancing\n\nHow to 
 join: Just show up\n\nBefore you go: Thursdays are posted through Nov 19. 
 Nov 26 is Thanksgiving\, and December through February dates aren't posted
  yet. Check the $5 price before you go.\n\nhttps://www.transfercofoodhall.
 com/upcoming-events\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.transfercofoodhall.com/upcoming-events
END:VEVENT
