UID:r-swing-dance-20261115@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261119T001009Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T220000
SUMMARY:Sunday night swing · Raleigh Elks Lodge
LOCATION:Raleigh Elks Lodge No. 735\, 5538 Lead Mine Rd\, Raleigh\, NC
DESCRIPTION:Large weekly swing dance with a free lesson\, often 100+ dancer
 s on a typical Sunday. Some Sundays add afternoon sessions: ballroom on th
 e 1st Sunday\, country on the 2nd.\n\nFree East Coast Swing lesson at 6pm\
 ; Lindy/ECS/Blues 7–8:45pm\; West Coast Swing and Hustle 8:45–10pm\n\n
 How to join: Just show up\n\nBefore you go: North Raleigh\, about 15 minut
 es from downtown. The holiday Sundays (Dec 20 and 27) and January-February
  aren't listed. Check the site.\n\nhttps://www.carolinadanceclub.com/\n\nL
 isted on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.carolinadanceclub.com/
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="5538 Lead Mine Rd, Raleigh
 , NC";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Raleigh Elks Lodge No. 735":geo:35.855949
 ,-78.671665
END:VEVENT
