BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:r-taco-tuesday-ride-20261117@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261119T001009Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261117T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261117T200000
SUMMARY:Taco Tuesday bike ride · Raleigh Brewing
LOCATION:Raleigh Brewing Company\, 3709 Neil St\, Raleigh\, NC 27607
DESCRIPTION:Weekly group road ride in three pace groups\, then tacos and be
 er at the brewery.\n\nCheck-in and rollout at 6pm. Pace groups: A about 20
  mph\, B social 13-15 mph\, C beginner-friendly 12-13 mph.\n\nHow to join:
  Just show up\; RSVP on Meetup is optional\n\nBefore you go: Check that ri
 des continue through the winter. It's dark at rollout\, so bring front and
  rear lights.\n\nhttps://www.meetup.com/raleigh-brewing-walk-cycle-run-tri
 via-fun/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.meetup.com/raleigh-brewing-walk-cycle-run-trivia-fun/
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="3709 Neil St, Raleigh, NC 
 27607";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Raleigh Brewing Company":geo:35.793005,-
 78.686029
