DESCRIPTION:Very active downtown running group whose Saturday long run ends
  with a group breakfast.\n\n6-10+ miles with pace groups from sub-7 to 10+
  min/mile\, then coffee or breakfast. The club also runs Tuesdays at 6am f
 rom Yellow Dog Bread Co. (219 E Franklin St).\n\nHow to join: RSVP on Meet
 up and show up\n\nBefore you go: Early start\; check Meetup for holiday we
 ekends.\n\nhttps://meetup.com/the-breakfast-club-runners\n\nListed on Same
  Time Next Week.
