SUMMARY:Climbing meetup · Triangle Rock Club (Salvage Yard)
LOCATION:Triangle Rock Club - Salvage Yard (location rotates)\, 2330 Salvag
 e Yard Dr\, Raleigh\, NC 27604
DESCRIPTION:Climbing group running since 2006. Beginners and people who can
 't belay yet are welcome\, and dinner afterward is part of the routine.\n\
 nThe group rotates between Triangle Rock Club gyms each Friday: Nov 13 her
 e at Salvage Yard\, Nov 20 at the Durham gym. Optional group dinner around
  8:45pm.\n\nHow to join: RSVP on Meetup\n\nBefore you go: Later Raleigh Fr
 idays aren't visible yet. Check the Meetup page each week.\n\nhttps://www.
 meetup.com/raleighrockclimbing/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.meetup.com/raleighrockclimbing/
END:VEVENT
