SUMMARY:Holiday meal packing · Christ the King Presbyterian
LOCATION:Christ the King Presbyterian Church (packing and distribution site
 )\, 1417 Clifton St\, Raleigh\, NC 27604
DESCRIPTION:Pack and deliver holiday meals in teams with the Raleigh Rescue
  Mission. Unlike its onsite shifts\, no training is required.\n\nThanksgiv
 ing: packing Sun Nov 22 and Nov 23-25\, delivery Thu Nov 26. Christmas: pa
 cking Dec 21-22\, delivery Dec 23. Shift times are on SignUpGenius.\n\nHow
  to join: Sign up on SignUpGenius: there's one sign-up for Thanksgiving an
 d another for Christmas.\n\nBefore you go: Regular onsite volunteering at 
 the Mission (314 E Hargett St) requires orientation and is for ages 16+.\n
 \nhttps://www.raleighrescue.org/volunteer\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week
 .
