 alone.\n\nCheck-in around 6:45pm\n\nHow to join: Buy a ticket in advance o
 n the Skip the Small Talk site. An RSVP on Meetup isn't enough\, and event
 s often sell out with no tickets at the door.\n\nBefore you go: Only Dec 2
  is posted for Raleigh\; the group's other nights are in Durham. Watch for
  January and February dates.\n\nhttps://www.meetup.com/skip-the-small-talk
 -raleigh/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
