 1
DESCRIPTION:Weekday-afternoon pickleball hosted by a downtown church\; no e
 xperience is required. It's a low-pressure way to meet people while learni
 ng the game.\n\nHow to join: Show up at 1pm on a Monday or Wednesday. To c
 onfirm where to go first\, call the church office at (919) 821-5750.\n\nBe
 fore you go: Call the church office at (919) 821-5750 to ask where to ente
 r and whether loaner paddles are available.\n\nhttps://fpcraleigh.org/even
 ts/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://fpcraleigh.org/events/
