LOCATION:Pullen Arts Center (online)\, 105 Pullen Rd\, Raleigh\, NC 27607
DESCRIPTION:Online registration opens for Pullen Arts Center's January to A
 pril classes\, including pottery\, printmaking and jewelry. Popular classe
 s can fill quickly.\n\nHow to join: Register online through Raleigh RecLin
 k\, or call 919-996-6126 once the center opens.\n\nhttps://raleighnc.gov/a
 rts/take-class-pullen-arts-center\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
