DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261122T163000
SUMMARY:Food sorting · Food 4 Thought
LOCATION:Food 4 Thought Raleigh\, Raleigh\, NC (exact address given when yo
 u sign up)
DESCRIPTION:Help sort food for a Raleigh hunger-relief nonprofit during Hun
 ger & Homelessness Awareness Week. A 'Share it!' shift follows from 4:30 t
 o 6:30pm the same day.\n\nHow to join: Sign up for 'Sort it!' from Food 4 
 Thought Raleigh on Activate Good's volunteer portal (search for the title)
 . Spots are limited.\n\nBefore you go: Each shift has only a few spots\; m
 ore dates are posted on the same Activate Good sign-up.\n\nhttps://volunte
 er.activategood.org/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://volunteer.activategood.org/
END:VEVENT
