SUMMARY:Friday Night Magic · Game Theory
LOCATION:Game Theory (Duraleigh Corners)\, 5910 Duraleigh Rd #125\, Raleigh
 \, NC 27612
DESCRIPTION:Weekly casual Magic: The Gathering tournament night with three 
 formats: a booster draft\, Standard and Modern. Each round pairs you with 
 a new opponent.\n\nThree events run side by side: a Star Trek booster draf
 t\, Standard and Modern. No Friday Night Magic on Nov 27 (Black Friday sal
 e).\n\nHow to join: Show up a little early to register and pay in the stor
 e\n\nhttps://gametheorystore.com/calendar/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Wee
 k.
