SUMMARY:Folky Friday song circle · UU Fellowship of Raleigh
LOCATION:Unitarian Universalist Fellowship of Raleigh (Peace Hall\, Room 20
 1)\, 3313 Wade Ave\, Raleigh\, NC 27607
DESCRIPTION:A low-key acoustic song circle. Everyone sits in a circle with 
 a shared folk songbook and takes turns choosing a song to sing or play.\n\
 nRoom 201 in Peace Hall\; park in the upper lot.\n\nHow to join: Just show
  up\n\nhttps://uufr.org/connect/music-at-uufr/\n\nListed on Same Time Next
  Week.
