DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T213000
SUMMARY:Coffee House open mic · UU Fellowship of Raleigh
LOCATION:Unitarian Universalist Fellowship of Raleigh (Founders Hall)\, 331
 3 Wade Ave\, Raleigh\, NC 27607
