 o lesson.\n\nHow to join: Just show up\n\nBefore you go: Check holiday sch
 edule\; Dec 2 is a special $15 Triangle Jazz Orchestra night\; check pulle
 ndance.org calendar\n\nhttps://sites.google.com/view/pullendance/home\n\nL
 isted on Same Time Next Week.
